        "official_en_sha256": "e0ad174c3efa2fd7ab9d8f7a12539a2aa9008fcaae39119741935b49f09e421d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さあ、ここに白輝石があるはずじゃ。\r\n早く探して、あのおばばに持っていくぞい。",
        "official_en": "...That white jade stone should be here. We shall find it quickly and deliver it to that babushka.",
        "real_en": "The White Shining Stone should be here. Let's find it quickly and take it to that old woman."
      },
      "review": {
