        "official_en_sha256": "8dc0f876c0c864082a104715cc5849948d75aa94e567dcdfd0c85de599152acb"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうじゃ。\r\n闇のクリスタルが壊されれば、最後の楔がなくなり\r\nこの大地はゲートを通じてパラデイアに戻る。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. And if the Dark Crystal is destroyed, the last seal will be undone and this land will be flung back to Paladia through the gate.",
        "real_en": "Right. If the Dark Crystal is destroyed, the final wedge will be gone, and this land will return to Paladia through the gate."
      },
      "review": {
