      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その際の衝撃は凄まじいものじゃ。\r\nこの世界に落ちるときには\r\n大地の半分が吹き飛んだしのう。",
        "official_en": "The resulting impact will be cataclysmic. Why, half of Lapis’s land was swept away when a piece of Paladia first plummeted unto it.",
        "real_en": "The impact will be tremendous. When it fell into this world, half the land was blown away."
      },
