      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、次元移動に耐えうる飛空艇……。\r\nインビンシブルが必要だったのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "’Tis why they coveted an airship that can withstand the passage through the gate...in other words, the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>.",
        "real_en": "That's why they needed an airship that could withstand traveling between dimensions... the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>."
      },
