      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だとすると……\r\nこの施設にいたアルドールの奴らは\r\n今、どこにいるんだろうな。",
        "official_en": "So what happened to the people from Aldore who were here before?",
        "real_en": "Then... Where are the Aldorians who used to be here now?"
