        "official_en_sha256": "56d7abccf4488b05226b43e521309be5f9d0f7bcc43df27627245289860a27cf"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ひどい話……。\r\n六盟傑がアルドールを恨む気持ちもわかるよ。",
        "official_en": "That’s...awful... I can see why the Sworn Six hate Aldore so much.",
        "real_en": null
