        "official_en_sha256": "6977e74551241f7ae58896303b7ad64550cb16f085e17e147a2555da646ca4bd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "パラデイアの人間は寿命が長いんじゃないのか？\r\nサクラちゃんたちだってまだ生きてるし。",
        "official_en": "But seeing as you and the Sworn Six are still kicking about, don’t Paladians live for a really, really long time?",
        "real_en": "Don't people from Paladia have long lifespans? Sakura-chan and the others are still alive."
      },
