        "official_en_sha256": "3318258f36537c949ccefb52dc9e6ba8cebd3dac7b53fe45da01d636faf70a92"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ワシら八盟傑は\r\n不老不死に近い肉体を手に入れておる。\r\n上層部によって戦争に適した体にされたのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "The Sworn Eight have attained nigh-immortality. Our leaders saw it fit to alter our bodies to be perfectly suited to war.",
        "real_en": "We Sworn Eight were given bodies that barely age and are nearly immortal. Aldore's leaders altered our bodies to make us suited for war."
      },
