      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "大地ごと飛ばされたわけだからね。\r\n当然、その上にあった施設も\r\nこっちに飛ばされたってわけ。",
        "official_en": "A vast swath of land was transported here. Naturally, the buildings on its surface were brought along as well.",
